## Preferences (durable across trips)

- **Self-catering apartments preferred** over hotels with breakfast — cooking some
  meals matters more to the budget than hotel amenities
- **Cash bookings only** — no interest in credit-card points/miles optimization,
  award flights, or loyalty-program stacking. Skip any tool/toolkit oriented around
  that (e.g. travel-hacking-toolkit's Duffel/Ignav/seats.aero/transfer-partner
  skills are out of scope here — only its free no-auth flight/hotel MCP servers
  would ever be relevant, and weren't needed once account connectors were fixed)
- **Budget-conscious, not fixed** — the Bulgaria trip target was 8,000 ILS for 7
  days all-in, but that number is trip-specific, not a standing rule. Always ask
  for the budget for a new trip rather than assuming it carries over
- **Kids are still learning** — for activity/sport trips, plan around beginner
  instruction (e.g. ski lessons) rather than assuming existing skill

